WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
These financial-services
outcomes have separate meanings.

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:06.800
The examples report test-creation
time, coverage of a selected

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:10.960
module and major incidents.
The incident reduction comes from a wider

00:00:11.006 --> 00:00:14.880
modernization case, with AI testing
introduced later as a pilot.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.200
Do not combine the numbers
or attribute every improvement to AI.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:22.480
Use each case to identify
a practice worth testing,

00:00:22.512 --> 00:00:26.240
then establish the client's own
baseline and evaluation conditions.
